# Dictionary food_quantity_pairs contains two key-value pairs each representing a food name and the quantity ordered. Complete the following steps:

# Read a string from input into variable key_name, representing a food name.
# Modify the quantity associated with key_name so that the updated value is the original value minus 1. CODE:


